  "description": "“I will become a demon.”\n\nA young man with a dark past, known in Murim as Won-Su.\nAfter living a life without an identity, he feels remorseful.\nHe finds a lover, which he thinks must have been fate.\nAfter losing his mother, he escapes Jungwon, but gets caught up in Murim and ends up losing his wife.\n\nEven so, he grows older alone, without getting involved...\n\n(Source: Mootoon, translated)",
